{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3", "label": "Pilot test screenshot: cleaning dashboard with overdue in-progress task (inf06-3)", "file_type": "image", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Evidence capture from pilot test report 06 (figure 3): the operator PWA at dt4fm-system-f7cc.vercel.app/dashboard shows a cleaning task (Limpiez0004) still 'En ejecucion' with an in-progress banner reporting 332h 29min elapsed and 'tiempo excedido', with Chrome DevTools open (3 issues) - documents a task that was never closed and whose timer kept running."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_dashboard_mantenimiento_limpieza", "label": "Dashboard 'Mantenimiento y Limpieza' (operator task screen)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mobile-first single-column layout (~600px content, DevTools docked right) aimed at field operators: header with Construiblec branding + welcome + notification bell, 'Mis tareas' section, segmented toggle, phase filter, task cards, red floating action button and a two-item bottom nav (Tareas / Cuenta)."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_banner_tarea_en_progreso", "label": "In-progress task banner ('Tarea en progreso' with elapsed time and 'tiempo excedido')", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Sticky orange top banner that persists across the app while a task is running: shows task code (Limpiez0004), elapsed time (332h 29min) and a 'tiempo excedido' flag once elapsed time exceeds the estimated duration, plus a 'Regresar' button to jump back into the running task. Design intent: keep the operator anchored to the active task and make overruns visible."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_tarjeta_tarea_limpiez0004", "label": "Task card Limpiez0004 (R312 - Estudio 12, 'En ejecucion')", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Card shows date badge (20 ago), status chip 'En ejecucion', location, planned start 12:00 p.m., planned end 01:00 p.m., estimated duration 1h, 'Tarea con retraso de: 12min' and a warning 'Empezaste con 00:11:34 de retraso'. Planned times + estimated duration are the basis for both the lateness label and the banner's exceeded-time flag."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_tarea_atrasada", "label": "'Tarea atrasada' delayed-task indicator (orange side stripe + start-delay warning)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lateness is surfaced redundantly: a vertical 'TAREA ATRASADA' label on the card's orange left stripe, a 'Tarea con retraso de: 12min' line, and a warning box 'Empezaste con 00:11:34 de retraso'. The delay is computed from planned start vs actual start (start delay), which is a different metric from the banner's elapsed-vs-estimated overrun."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_hallazgo_tiempo_excedido", "label": "Pilot finding: task left running for 332h (timer never stopped / task not closed)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The banner reports 332h 29min elapsed (~14 days) for a 1h task dated 20 ago that is still 'En ejecucion'. This is the observation the figure documents: the in-progress state persisted because the operator never finished the task, so the elapsed timer and 'tiempo excedido' flag are technically correct but the value is meaningless; suggests a need for auto-closing / stale-task handling or a reminder mechanism."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_toggle_mantenimiento_limpieza", "label": "Segmented toggle Mantenimiento / Limpieza", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two-state pill control under 'Mis tareas' that switches the task list between maintenance and cleaning tasks; 'Limpieza' is active (dark fill). Reflects the two task families the operator app handles."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_filtro_fases", "label": "Phase filter ('Todas las fases' dropdown with clear button)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Filter bar with a funnel icon, a select defaulting to 'Todas las fases' and an eraser/clear button; implies cleaning tasks are grouped by phase (workflow state) and the list can be narrowed by it."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_pwa_install_prompt", "label": "PWA install prompt 'Instala Construiblec'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blue dismissible banner ('Acceso directo y mas rapido desde tu inicio', 'Instalar' button) shows the operator app is a Progressive Web App with a custom install prompt, intended to be added to the home screen of field staff devices."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_fab_alerta", "label": "Red floating action button (alarm/bell icon)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Circular red FAB anchored bottom-right over the task list with an alarm-bell glyph; its exact action is not visible in the capture (likely incident/alert reporting)."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_bottom_nav", "label": "Bottom navigation (Tareas / Cuenta)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Two-tab bottom bar (Tareas active, Cuenta) - minimal navigation surface for the operator role."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_vercel_deploy", "label": "Vercel deployment dt4fm-system-f7cc.vercel.app/dashboard", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The pilot was run against a Vercel-hosted build of the frontend (dashboard route), i.e. a preview/production deployment rather than localhost."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_devtools_console_issues", "label": "Chrome DevTools console open with 3 issues (1 error, 2 messages)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The screenshot was taken with DevTools docked (Console tab, '3 issues' badge, 1 error flagged) indicating the tester was inspecting the page for runtime errors while reproducing the observation."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_wilmer_palma", "label": "Pilot operator user 'Wilmer Palma'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Logged-in account shown in the header ('Bienvenido, Wilmer Palma') - the cleaning operator whose task list is displayed during the pilot."}, {"id": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_ubicacion_r312_estudio_12", "label": "Location 'R312 - Estudio 12'", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Room/unit code + name pattern (R312 - Estudio 12) used to identify the space a cleaning task belongs to."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_dashboard_mantenimiento_limpieza", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_hallazgo_tiempo_excedido", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_vercel_deploy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_devtools_console_issues", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_dashboard_mantenimiento_limpieza", "target": "docs_pruebas_piloto_img_inf06_3_banner_tarea_en_progreso", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/pruebas-piloto/img-inf06-3.png", "source_location": null, 